title: "INDoS WG3 Training School 2026: standards, data, environments (slides)"
abstract: >-
  Slides on standardized preprocessing with fMRIPrep as the reference model,
  the Brain Imaging Data Structure across modalities, and containers, with the
  welcome and introduction to INDoS and its Working Group 3, prepared for the
  Training School of Working Group 3 of the INDoS COST Action (CA24161),
  Madrid, 30 September to 2 October 2026.
